082/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/highlight/highlight/issues/5082/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/highlight/highlight/issues/5082/events","html_url":"https://github.com/highlight/highlight/issues/5082","id":1679184280,"node_id":"I_kwDOETrouc5kFlGY","number":5082,"title":"Support Elixir among our SDKs","user":{"login":"jay-khatri","id":20292680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjkyNjgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20292680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri","html_url":"https://github.com/jay-khatri","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jay-khatri/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":2289841065,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjg5ODQxMDY1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/highlight/highlight/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":5096574258,"node_id":"LA_kwDOETrouc8AAAABL8eNMg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/highlight/highlight/labels/external%20bug%20/%20request","name":"external bug / request","color":"8FD635","default":false,"description":"Bugs related to external customers, users, etc.."},{"id":5426616458,"node_id":"LA_kwDOETrouc8AAAABQ3OYig","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/highlight/highlight/labels/sdk","name":"sdk","color":"7A5325","default":false,"description":""},{"id":5874195521,"node_id":"LA_kwDOETrouc8AAAABXiEcQQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/highlight/highlight/labels/%F0%9F%92%8E%20Bounty","name":"💎 Bounty","color":"4f46e5","default":false,"description":null},{"id":5896036273,"node_id":"LA_kwDOETrouc8AAAABX25fsQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/highlight/highlight/labels/%F0%9F%92%B0%20Rewarded","name":"💰 Rewarded","color":"15803d","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":32,"created_at":"2023-04-21T22:38:27Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T10:25:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"A ticket to track support for a set of Elixir SDKs. These should support:\r\n- Error Monitoring\r\n- Logging\r\n\r\nThis is a good starting point on how to make an SDK for Highlight.io: https://www.highlight.io/docs/general/company/open-source/contributing/adding-an-sdk\r\n\r\nAnd like all of our other SDKs, we should wrap the OTEL equivalent: \r\nhttps://opentelemetry.io/docs/instrumentation/erlang/\r\n\r\nFor anyone interested in contributing, please post here. We're happy to help. cc @Vadman97 @et \r\n\r\nThe SDK should implement the following:\r\n* a way to `H.recordException` following the otel exception reporting spec.\r\n* a way to instrument Elixir logging libraries. if the Elixir sdk supports logs natively, it would be great to route them to as LogRecords on `v1/logs`, but if not, fine to support them as trace events. \r\n* Integrate cleanly with Phoenix, allowing to hook into built in [error monitoring](https://hexdocs.pm/phoenix/custom_error_pages.html#actionable-errors) and [logging](https://hexdocs.pm/phoenix/Phoenix.Channel.html#module-logging).\r\n\r\nas part of the exception implementation, if Elixir backend frameworks follow a common format for tracing HTTP request handlers, it would be great to wrap those as native otel traces.\r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n* a `init` method that sets up the Elixir instrumentation to collect console logs automatically.\r\n* a `recordException` method that allows capturing errors manually (see [java sdk](https://www.highlight.io/docs/sdk/java) as an example).\r\n* support [Phoenix Live View](https://hexdocs.pm/phoenix_live_view/Phoenix.LiveView.html) instrumentation","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/highlight/highlight/issues/5082/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/highlight/highlight/issues/5082/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/70","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/70/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/70/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/70/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/70","id":4630070621,"node_id":"I_kwDOSuNQNs8AAAABE_lFXQ","number":70,"title":"🎯 Bounty Alert: 21 New Opportunityies found","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11114445492,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSuNQNs8AAAAClnj6tA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/labels/bounty-alert","name":"bounty-alert","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-06-10T09:57:54Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T09:57:54Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Active Bounty Scan Results\n\n**Scan Time:** 2026-06-10 09:57 UTC\n\n#### 1. [Auth validators should reject whitespace-only passwords](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/6430)\n- **Repository:** [SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty](https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty)\n- **Comments:** 0\n- **Last Updated:** 2026-06-10T09:51:37Z\n\n#### 2. [[bounty] markdown-it-plain-text npm package lacks bugs metadata](https://github.com/charles-openclaw/charles-microbounties/issues/864)\n- **Repository:** [charles-openclaw/charles-microbounties](https://github.com/charles-openclaw/charles-microbounties)\n- **Comments:** 2\n- **Last Updated:** 2026-06-10T09:50:03Z\n\n#### 3. [RTC Claim - 2026-06-10 09:49:24 UTC](https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bount