ies](https://github.com/charles-openclaw/charles-microbounties)\n- **Comments:** 2\n- **Last Updated:** 2026-06-10T09:40:04Z\n\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/70/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vansh-09/BountyScout/issues/70/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/223","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/223/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/223/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/223/events","html_url":"https://github.com/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/223","id":4584215696,"node_id":"I_kwDOSvpFLM8AAAABET2UkA","number":223,"title":"[BUG] POST /users has mass assignment vulnerability — no input validation","user":{"login":"pangtongya","id":100079486,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfcXfg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100079486?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya","html_url":"https://github.com/pangtongya","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pangtongya/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-06-03T22:45:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-09T09:06:50Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bug Description\n\nThe `POST /users` endpoint in `apps/api/src/routes/users.ts` blindly spreads `req.body` into the response without any validation:\n\n```ts\nrouter.post(\"/\", (req, res) => {\n  res.status(201).json({\n    data: {\n      id: \"stub-user-id\",\n      ...req.body\n    },\n    message: \"User creation is not implemented yet.\"\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## Security Implications\n\n1. **Mass assignment**: An attacker can inject arbitrary fields into the response by sending them in the request body (e.g., `{\"role\": \"admin\", \"isVerified\": true}`)\n2. **No type checking**: The endpoint accepts any JSON body without validating field types or structure\n3. **No sanitization**: User input flows directly into the response without any filtering\n\n## Severity\n\n**Medium** — While this is currently a stub endpoint, it establishes a dangerous pattern that could propagate to production endpoints. Even in stub form, unexpected fields can confuse API consumers and integration tests.\n\n## Proposed Fix\n\nAdd Zod schema validation:\n\n```ts\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\n\nconst createUserSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  name: z.string().min(1).optional(),\n});\n\nrouter.post(\"/\", (req, res) => {\n  const parsed = createUserSchema.safeParse(req.body);\n  if (!parsed.success) {\n    return res.status(400).json({ error: parsed.error.flatten() });\n  }\n  res.status(201).json({\n    data: {\n      id: \"stub-user-id\",\n      email: parsed.data.email,\n      name: parsed.data.name,\n    },\n    message: \"User creation is not implemented yet.\"\n  });\n});\n```\n\n## References\n\n- Per the bug bounty program described in #33\n- OWASP: [Mass Assignment Vulnerability](https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Mass_Assignment_Cheat_Sheet.html)\n\n/bounty $400","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/223/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xevrion-v2/agent-playground/issues/223/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/161","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/161/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/161/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/161/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/161","id":4620030021,"node_id":"I_kwDOSmCMss8AAAABE2AQRQ","number":161,"title":"🎯 Bounty Alert: 20 New Opportunityies found","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c