n":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bug\n\n`POST /api/reviews` accepts and stores arbitrary request bodies. That lets clients create reviews without the required database-backed fields, use ratings outside the normal 1-5 range, or persist unexpected properties that do not belong to the Review model.\n\n## Reproduction\n\n1. Start an app with `createApp()`.\n2. Send `POST /api/reviews` with a JSON body such as `{ rating: 6, comment: bad, reviewerId: u1, revieweeId: u2, adminOverride: true }`.\n3. The API returns success and stores the unvalidated payload.\n\n## Expected\n\nReview creation should validate the payload before storage. Required fields should match the Review model shape, ratings should be integers from 1 through 5, comments and IDs should be non-empty, and unexpected properties should be rejected with a 400 response.\n\nParent bounty: #743","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/5820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/5820/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/5162","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/5162/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/5162/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/5162/events","html_url":"https://github.com/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/5162","id":4602113887,"node_id":"I_kwDOSfPzA88AAAABEk6vXw","number":5162,"title":"Reject upload requests that omit the multipart file field","user":{"login":"Thecesar85","id":34018193,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDE4MTkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34018193?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85","html_url":"https://github.com/Thecesar85","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Thecesar85/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-06T05:37:18Z","updated_at":"2026-06-08T09:35:16Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bug\n\n`POST /api/uploads` currently returns `201` with `success: true` even when the multipart request does not include a `file` field. The response reports `status: \"no-file\"`, but it is still treated as a successful upload by HTTP status and response shape.\n\n## Expected fix\n\n- Reject upload requests that do not include a file with a clear `400` response\n- Keep successful upload responses reserved for requests that actually include `req.file`\n- Add route-level regression coverage for the missing-file case\n\n## Related\n\n- Mirrors original issue `#4680`\n- Parent Algora bounty: `#743`\n\nCreated because issue `#4680` is limited to the creator of that issue, and the repository explicitly asks other contributors to create another issue with the same contents and refer to `#743`.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/5162/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SecureBananaLabs/bug-bounty/issues/5162/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/148","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/148/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/148/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/148/events","html_url":"https://github.com/dev-kp-eloper/BountyScout/issues/148","id":4610358084,"node_id":"I_kwDOSmCMss8AAAABEsx7RA","number":148,"title":"🎯 Bounty Alert: 30 New Opportunityies found","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users